# Privacy patterns — tracked in the repo so CI runs the same gate as a
# local build. One extended-regex per line. Lines starting with '#' are
# comments. Blank lines are ignored.
#
# Override the whole file with AQM_PRIVACY_PATTERNS=<path>.
#
# The UUID shape matches any UUID, including real account UUIDs. The
# synthetic test fixtures use aaaaaaaaa-0000-4000-8000-… and
# bbbbbbbb-0000-4000-8000-…, which are allowlisted in ci.sh.
[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}
